### Create Holiday
POST http://localhost:8000/api/holidays
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "holidayName": "Republic Day",
  "holidayDate": "2027-01-26",
  "holidayType": "NATIONAL"
}

###

### Get All Holidays
GET http://localhost:8000/api/holidays

###

### Get Holiday By Id
GET http://localhost:8000/api/holidays/1

###

### Delete Holiday
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/holidays/1

###